 part1='The supplied model is Анна Петрова / ул. Садовая, д. 12, кв. 4 / г. Казань / Республика Татарстан / Россия / 420000. It contains a recipient, premises, locality, regional unit, country and postcode. A numeric postal code and a locality perform different roles. The UPU sheet describes a six-digit Russian postcode and illustrates delivery-office coding; a displayed sample code is not a live delivery lookup. A greeting does not replace a recipient name. Recognize each requested component before trying to arrange a whole address.\n\n'+'\n\n'.join(i['promptLetter']+' — '+i['feedback']+' Other labels: '+ '; '.join(i['distractorRationales'][n] for n,x in enumerate(i['options']) if x!=i['answer']) for i in items if i['assessment']['testedFeature'] in {'LOCALITY_ROLE','ADDRESSEE_ROLE','STREET_AND_PREMISES','SIX_DIGIT_POSTCODE','REJECTED_GREETING','REGIONAL_UNIT_AS_APPLICABLE','COUNTRY_COMPONENT'})
